{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测WindowsOffice可疑加载taskschd.dll。对应需求：持久化。官方：Suspicious Image Load (taskschd.dll) from MS Office。","from":"now-9m","index":["winlogbeat-*","logs-endpoint.events.library-*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*","endgame-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】WindowsOffice可疑加载taskschd.dll","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindowsOffice可疑加载taskschd.dll\n\n### 为何重要\n在重启或登录后保持立足点\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","references":["https://medium.com/threatpunter/detecting-adversary-tradecraft-with-image-load-event-logging-and-eql-8de93338c16","https://www.clearskysec.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/Operation-Quicksand.pdf"],"risk_score":21,"rule_id":"baa5d22c-5e1c-4f33-bfc9-efa73bb53022","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 持久化","来源: 默认","对应需求: 持久化"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"any where host.os.type == \"windows\" and\n (event.category : (\"library\", \"driver\") or (event.category == \"process\" and event.action : \"Image loaded*\")) and\n  process.name : (\"WINWORD.EXE\", \"EXCEL.EXE\", \"POWERPNT.EXE\", \"MSPUB.EXE\", \"MSACCESS.EXE\") and\n  (?dll.name : \"taskschd.dll\" or file.name : \"taskschd.dll\")\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1053","name":"Scheduled Task/Job","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1053/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1053.005","name":"Scheduled Task","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1053/005/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0003","name":"Persistence","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0003/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1559","name":"Inter-Process Communication","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1559/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1559.001","name":"Component Object Model","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1559/001/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":215,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
